<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Document</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.4.1/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="mb-5">
        <%- include('myheader') %>
    </div>
    <br>
        <div class="container mt-5 text-secondary text-center">
            <h1><b>HELP</b></h1>
            <hr style="color: gray;height: 4px;width: 160px;background-color: black;position: relative;left: 480px;top: -6px;">
        </div>
        <div class="container">
            <div class="mt-5">
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <image src="/help1" >
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-10">
                        <h3>Introduction</h3>
                        <p> Motorlux prides itself in building advanced and intelligent cars that are both fun to own, yet extremely reliable. In the same way,  Motorlux wants your online visits to be both rewarding and pleasurable, so you keep returning here to discover more about new  Motorlux products, motorsport news, environmental issues and many other automotive-related topics. For your convenience, the following section aims to help you get the most out of this website. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-10" align="right">
                        <h3>How to navigate this website</h3>
                        <p> All information areas on this website can be reached by using the navigation links on the left-hand menu. You can enter a specific section by clicking one of the these main items (e.g. Technology). Sub-menus then appear below (e.g. Technology > Engines) with the next opportunity to explore, and they then link to all the subjects in that section. To enhance your site orientation, sections and pages you have just clicked are highlighted in red. And no matter where you go, you can always return to the homepage by clicking on the Motorlux logo in the upper-left corner. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <image src="/help2" >
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <image src="/help3" >
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-10">
                        <h3>Other navigation tools</h3>
                        <p>There are also several additional navigation aids to help you during your online session. Below the Toyota logo you have a search field and buttons for "Home", "Sitemap" and "Help". Here you can either search the entire site by entering a keyword in the Search field, or go to Sitemap to view the website in different levels of detail, or click Help and reach this page. If you scroll down a page and want to get back to the top, just click the "back to top" link in the bottom-right corner of each page. </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-10" align="right">
                        <h3>How to contact Motorlux </h3>
                        <p>The buttons in the upper-right menu allow you to: locate your nearest Toyota dealership, plan your new Motorlux by choosing engine, equipment, wheels etc., book a test drive, order a brochure on your favourite model, book a service for your Motorlux, or obtain a price list. At the bottom of the site you also have links to mail a particular page to a friend, print a page, bookmark a page, or to contact the NK-Motor Webmaster when necessary. Please note: Any personal data you provide to TMC via the Toyota sites will only be used by Motorlux to improve the services Motorlux provides to you. TMC makes every effort to insure the secure collection, transmission and storage of personal data in accordance with the nature of such data. TMC will not transfer your personal data to third parties, except to the other entities in the Toyota distribution network. You have at all times the right to access to, rectification of and objection to the use of the personal data. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <img src="/headerlogo" height="150px" width="100%" style="position: relative;top: 24%;">
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <image src="/help5" >
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-10">
                        <h3>Browser versions </h3>
                        <p>This website is best-viewed using Internet Explorer 10 or higher, Google Chrome and Mozilla Firefox.  </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-lg-10" align="right">
                        <h3>Plug-ins for total pleasure </h3>
                        <p>This Toyota site aims to create an exciting user-friendly experience and offers complete interaction with the full line-up of Toyota vehicles. The most frequently-used plug-in on this site is Flash, and this plug-in will allow you to see almost all the site. However, to enjoy the multimedia section to the full, you may have to download extra plug-ins. These, along with Flash, are listed and explained in the right column of this page. </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-lg-2">
                        <image src="/help6" >
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    <br>
    <div class="mt-5">
        <%- include('myfooter') %>
    </div>
</body>
</html>